// Persistent On-Disk Incremental Query & Codegen Cache (`.axiom-cache`),
// Hermetic `ActionDigest` / `EnvironmentDigest` Validation, Versioned &
// Checksummed Binary Schema (`AXCACHE1`), Atomic Temp-File + Rename Publication,
// Graceful Corruption / Schema / Compiler-Digest Eviction Fallback, and
// `< 100 ms` Root Workspace Manifest No-Op Fast Path (T758 / E18.2).
// Implements SPEC-22 §3-§4 (AXS-INC-020..024, AXS-INC-050..053, INV-INC-002).
module compiler.incremental.cache

